<title>ITALY: Italian state railway FS 1996 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Italian state railway FS 1996 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state railways Ferrovie dello Stato showed a loss of 2.7 trillion lire in 1996, showing that it had moved 1.2 trillion lire further into the red compared with 1995.</p>
<p>The loss figure was given by Treasury minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi in his address on Wednesday to the parliamentary transport and telecommunications commission.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
